        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml CMED-High-Level-Architecture\n&#39; -----------------------------------------------------------------\n&#39;  CMED Fleet &amp; Operations Dashboard — high-level architecture\n&#39;  Import into draw.io: Arrange &gt; Insert &gt; Advanced &gt; PlantUML\n&#39;  Verified against actual source (frontend/ + backend/). Items\n&#39;  marked \&quot;unconfirmed\&quot; have no Dockerfile/docker-compose evidence.\n&#39; -----------------------------------------------------------------\ntitle &lt;b&gt;CMED Fleet &amp; Operations Dashboard&lt;/b&gt;\\nHigh-level architecture (read-only demo)\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam roundCorner 10\nskinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam ArrowColor #4C7A96\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1.4\nskinparam node {\n  BackgroundColor #F2F1EC\n  BorderColor #14232E\n}\nskinparam database {\n  BackgroundColor #EAF3F0\n  BorderColor #0E6E5D\n}\nskinparam note {\n  BackgroundColor #FBF3E6\n  BorderColor #D98E2B\n}\n\nactor \&quot;Operations staff /\\nICT admin\&quot; as user #14232E\n\nnode \&quot;Docker host (topology unconfirmed —\\nno Dockerfile/docker-compose in source)\&quot; as docker {\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Frontend container** (nginx)\&quot; as fe #EAF3F0 {\n    component \&quot;LandingPage\\nroute: \\\&quot;/\\\&quot; — no sidebar/header\&quot; as landing\n    component \&quot;App shell\\nSidebar + Header (wraps all other routes)\&quot; as shell\n    package \&quot;Pages — 11 components across 6 sections\&quot; as pages {\n      component \&quot;EVFleetPage\\nCombustionFleetPage\&quot; as pFleet\n      component \&quot;MaintenanceAlertsPage\\nServiceLogPage\&quot; as pMaint\n      component \&quot;RouteStatusPage\\nIncidentLogPage\&quot; as pTrans\n      component \&quot;AssetInventoryPage\\nAssetDetailPage\&quot; as pAssets\n      component \&quot;TicketListPage\\nTicketDetailPage\&quot; as pTickets\n      component \&quot;ComplianceTrackerPage\&quot; as pComp\n    }\n    component \&quot;Shared UI\\nCharts.jsx (Recharts), DataTable.jsx,\\nStatusBadge.jsx\&quot; as shared\n    component \&quot;Hooks\\nuseFleetData, useAssets, useTickets\\n(wrap api.js for some pages only)\&quot; as hooks\n    component \&quot;api.js (axios)\\nGET-only REST client, all 6 domains\&quot; as axios\n    component \&quot;nginx\\nserves static SPA,\\nproxies /api/* -&gt; backend:5000/\&quot; as nginx\n  }\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Backend container** (Flask)\&quot; as be #FBF3E6 {\n    component \&quot;run.py\\ndev entrypoint: app.run(debug=True)\\ngunicorn listed in requirements.txt\\nbut NOT confirmed as the actual\\nprod launch command (no Dockerfile)\&quot; as runpy\n    component \&quot;Flask app factory (__init__.py)\\nCORS, /api/health, 404/500 handlers\&quot; as flask\n    package \&quot;REST blueprints /api/*\\n13 endpoints total — ALL GET, read-only\&quot; as routes {\n      component \&quot;fleet\\n/ev  /combustion\\n/vehicles/&lt;id&gt;  /stats\&quot; as rFleet\n      component \&quot;maintenance\\n/alerts  /log\&quot; as rMaint\n      component \&quot;transport\\n/routes  /incidents\&quot; as rTrans\n      component \&quot;assets\\n(root)  /&lt;id&gt;\&quot; as rAssets\n      component \&quot;tickets\\n(root)  /&lt;id&gt;\\nmounted at /api/tickets\&quot; as rTickets\n      component \&quot;compliance\\n/departments\&quot; as rComp\n    }\n    package \&quot;services — defined but UNUSED\\n(no route imports these)\&quot; as svc #DDDDDD {\n      component \&quot;cost_calculator.py\\nfleet_service.py\\nmaintenance_service.py\&quot; as svcImpl\n    }\n    package \&quot;SQLAlchemy models\&quot; as models {\n      component \&quot;Vehicle, MaintenanceRecord, Route,\\nIncident, Asset, Ticket(+TicketComment),\\nComplianceCheck\&quot; as modelImpl\n    }\n    component \&quot;seed_data.py\\nseed_all_data() + per-table seed_*() fns\&quot; as seed\n  }\n\n  database \&quot;PostgreSQL\\n(cmed_dashboard)\\nversion unconfirmed in source\&quot; as db\n}\n\nuser --&gt; landing : browse \&quot;/\&quot;\nuser --&gt; shell : browse app routes\nshell -down-&gt; pages\npages -down-&gt; shared\npages -down-&gt; hooks : Fleet, Assets,\\nTickets pages\npages -down-&gt; axios : Transport, Maintenance\\npages call directly\nhooks -down-&gt; axios\naxios -down-&gt; nginx\nnginx -right-&gt; flask : proxy /api/* -&gt; backend:5000/\nrunpy -down-&gt; flask : create_app(), db.create_all(),\\nauto-seed if Vehicle table empty\nflask -down-&gt; routes\nroutes -down-&gt; models\nroutes .[#C4453C].right.&gt; svc : #C4453C not called\\nby any route\nmodels -down-&gt; db : SQL via SQLAlchemy\nrunpy ..&gt; seed : triggers on first boot\nseed -down-&gt; db : INSERT sample data\n\nnote right of nginx\n  **Prefix mismatch:** nginx strips \&quot;/api/\&quot; before\n  forwarding (proxy_pass ends in \&quot;/\&quot;), so /api/fleet/ev\n  is sent upstream as /fleet/ev — but Flask blueprints\n  are mounted at /api/fleet/*, /api/tickets/*, etc.\n  Unverified whether a Dockerfile/env var works\n  around this in the real deployment.\nend note\n\nnote bottom of db\n  Demo only. db.create_all() runs on every container\n  boot; Flask-Migrate/Alembic are configured but NOT\n  invoked at startup (no \&quot;flask db upgrade\&quot; call).\n  Every endpoint is read-only — 13 GET routes total,\n  confirmed against every blueprint file.\nend note\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="GGm9x8rHgc2vKtQstuy4-5">
